flowchart TD
    n0(["Enter stage"]):::terminal
    n1(["Spec worker · Draft repository-bound slices"]):::worker
    n2["Foreman · Validate repository and seam paths"]:::step
    n3(["Independent checker · Check and approve the plan"]):::worker
    n4["Foreman · File and link child issues"]:::step
    n5(["Cancelled"]):::terminal
    n6(["Run stops"]):::terminal
    n7(["Wrong repository"]):::terminal
    n8(["Plan revision limit reached"]):::terminal
    n9(["One slice clears both checks"]):::terminal
    n10(["Children filed"]):::terminal
    n11{{"Joe · Decide the unresolved product, repository, architecture or policy choice. Only an answer to the open question continues the run. Silence keeps the gate open. An unrelated reply does not count. Gates are only for unresolved questions. Plan approval never waits on Joe."}}:::gate
    n12{{"Joe · Resolve an intent choice identified by the independent checker. Only an answer to the open question continues the run. Silence keeps the gate open. An unrelated reply does not count. Gates are only for unresolved questions. Plan approval never waits on Joe."}}:::gate
    n0 -->|"Supplied slice"| n2
